Frontend languages: HTML, CSS, JavaScript
Frontend frameworks: React, Angular
Backend languages: JavaScript, Java, Python, Ruby
Backend frameworks: Node.js, Flask, Django

Backend components consist of 
client - client side, the part that faces the user.
server - powerful computer that is always available to recieve requests over the internet.
database - a souped up spreadsheet where you're storing all information related to the website.

Functions are first class objects and can be passed around as arguments

You can return inner functions in nested functions and assign a variable to it, allowing you to call the inner_function outside of the main funciton.

Decorator functions are functions that take an existing function and add additional functionality to them. To use these functions, put an @ in front of the decorator name.